{
  "id": "antigravity",
  "label": "Antigravity",
  "letter": "A",
  "color": "#34a853",
  "driver": "cli",
  "bin": [
    "agy",
    "%USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\bin\\agy.exe"
  ],
  "detect": [
    "%USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\bin\\agy.exe",
    "%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\antigravity\\resources\\bin\\language_server.exe",
    "%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Antigravity\\resources\\bin\\language_server.exe"
  ],
  "shortcuts": ["Antigravity"],
  "env": {
    "SSH_CONNECTION": "",
    "SSH_CLIENT": "",
    "SSH_TTY": ""
  },
  "note": "本机 CLI（Antigravity 自带的 agy）：会议室直接叫它，非交互跑一轮。读模式用 --mode plan --sandbox --dangerously-skip-permissions --disable-slash-commands（沙盒只读并避免非交互下调只读命令触发 request-review 拦截导致空回复），干活模式用 --mode accept-edits --dangerously-skip-permissions --disable-slash-commands。会话 id 取自 JSON 输出的 conversation_id，续接用 --conversation。--model 和 --effort 已实测（agy --help / agy models）；模型清单来自本机 agy models，也可自定义模型 ID。清空 SSH_* 是因为 agy 一看到 SSH 环境变量就改用文件令牌、读不到 Windows 已登录的凭据（从 SSH 会话里启动会议室时会认证失败）。",
  "args": {
    "base": [],
    "model": [
      "--model",
      "{model}"
    ],
    "effort": [
      "--effort",
      "{effort}"
    ],
    "read": ["--mode", "plan", "--sandbox", "--dangerously-skip-permissions", "--disable-slash-commands"],
    "work": ["--mode", "accept-edits", "--dangerously-skip-permissions", "--disable-slash-commands"],
    "new": ["--print=", "--input-format", "stream-json", "--output-format", "stream-json"],
    "resume": ["--conversation", "{session}", "--print=", "--input-format", "stream-json", "--output-format", "stream-json"]
  },
  "prompt": "stdin",
  "images": [],
  "parse": {
    "type": "ndjson",
    "text": "result.response",
    "session": "conversation_id",
    "filter": {"event": "result"}
  },
  "context": "delta",
  "models": [],
  "efforts": [
    "low",
    "medium",
    "high",
    "xhigh",
    "max"
  ],
  "default": [
    "",
    ""
  ],
  "caps": {
    "handoff": true
  },
  "handoff": "agy --conversation {session}"
}
